            "eyebrow": "Technology",
            "title": "Material science, not marketing adjectives",
            "body": "Three engineering decisions define how a Merryfair chair behaves over an eight-hour day: the mesh, the mechanism and the lumbar geometry.",
            "breadcrumb": [
              {
